tees."}]},{"id":"blk-40","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-104","text":"The consequence for an agent: "},{"id":"spn-105","marks":["bold"],"text":"a `docs/spec/` document that specifies Supabase tables, RLS or `amp.profiles` auth is describing the abandoned route."},{"id":"spn-106","text":" Several carry a supersession banner saying so. Read the banner before building from the document."}]},{"id":"blk-41","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-107","text":"Build and test"}]},{"id":"blk-42","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"cd graphonomous && mix deps.get && mix compile --warnings-as-errors && mix test && mix format --check-formatted\ncd locu.systems && npm install && npm run typecheck && npm run lint\ncd AmpersandBoxDesign/box-and-box && node test/laws.mjs && node test/compose-laws.mjs\ncd AmpersandBoxDesign/reference/elixir/ampersand_core && mix deps.get && mix escript.build"},{"id":"blk-43","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-108","text":"The law suites "},{"id":"spn-109","marks":["bold"],"text":"derive and print their own totals"},{"id":"spn-110","text":". Quote that output; never hand-type a law count. This has drifted twice."}]},{"id":"blk-44","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-111","text":"Graphonomous is the session memory loop"}]},{"id":"blk-45","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-112","text":"Treat Graphonomous MCP as always-on for every session in this tree, whatever subdirectory the task is in. It exposes "},{"id":"spn-113","marks":["bold"],"text":"five loop-phase machines"},{"id":"spn-114","text":" — "},{"id":"spn-115","marks":["code"],"text":"retrieve"},{"id":"spn-116","text":" → "},{"id":"spn-117","marks":["code"],"text":"route"},{"id":"spn-118","text":" → "},{"id":"spn-119","marks":["code"],"text":"act"},{"id":"spn-120","text":" → "},{"id":"spn-121","marks":["code"],"text":"learn"},{"id":"spn-122","text":" → "},{"id":"spn-123","marks":["code"],"text":"consolidate"},{"id":"spn-124","text":" — and PRISM adds six more 